{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6138ad75f7b33c97d3ffa0be4ad63ba19c4ec1418830577f29943523923fa76a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e397ebfc929a7eb1c58bd999f9bca61a2782da70b76c3d5e7211489cc40f5b62",
      "text": "老鼠招来的宝物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed669dc25efd998e1d687417ec636410c6fddc235278b7a81ccf16a5e974e3b8",
      "text": "大吾接到了骨董品鉴定节目的工作，去仓库寻找宝物。\n告知工作内容后，大吾表现出了反常的反应。\n察觉到异样的制作人为了询问缘由，\n决定换个地方慢慢聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e397ebfc929a7eb1c58bd999f9bca61a2782da70b76c3d5e7211489cc40f5b62",
      "text": "老鼠招来的宝物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1680fc1fe52d1dc76f42e889e5cc8322b788134ec21326a1f630c3af40b14d46",
      "text": "辛苦啦，Boss！俺来听工作的具体情况了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903ce882c0119a3512368787ab32898619945e25ff33fb41af5d55d0ecf31561",
      "text": "辛苦了！久等了。\n事不宜迟，我这就说明这次的工作内容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73d5f6e2497e2edb593930d1a2f05326877c7d656e998424a3e3e392e025962e",
      "text": "是一档骨董品鉴定节目，\n担任在仓库里寻找沉睡宝物的外景记者。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37da461e53167d988731f717f5a164be95c4005e058dc001f5b5ccaf73798ae8",
      "text": "在仓库……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:375a8f16bc054f7d2bcccfa89d8c260e1cd56dccf24f8b9400e6e9aa744656da",
      "text": "（既然是仓库的话，\n那家伙可能会在啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f6cb4e83f532f39a68a8c504d0ca00042d44fa83a6f4e995cde8ccbf1e7c86b",
      "text": "大吾先生，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d68b9c316011ee886dad6998c9cb0a4d90d7ea18026c654cf9065047fff2626",
      "text": "没、那个……没、没事的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e37945c521a2a35e7b2bcdd02cc5ebc8992dc5394de72503937072b9f499ac0c",
      "text": "（和平时的样子不太一样。\n说不定是有什么难言之隐）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3796d4fcff10c175f36c7f3c7d3712eded67ea663de7b39f8f7a695ada2523b0",
      "text": "大吾先生，方便的话请去会议室吧。\n在那里听您慢慢说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:484b6a1a77232322f83e9d347916e11ee9712dab20649dbfc154f2d5306920eb",
      "text": "哎！？没、其实也没到那个地步啦……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f28a8543ed70ffb2fa29341f163b2c65fbdf4544315da6cad90470cab4513d3",
      "text": "其、其实俺怕老鼠啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b48913912fb571b4e44631edea4e685dc3c9ec087ee7d8acda79aedc9871b76",
      "text": "原来是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a69e33402ea22327263eeb4d8d76535f1978460c550ddd5f248898862cf0b80f",
      "text": "闹得这么大真是不好意思……\n俺怎么都应付不来那家伙……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45ddbca078f9b460e904604c60218db3eaadbd2a9f13071be21df5467d73b32e",
      "text": "仓库里总是少不了老鼠的吧。\n所以俺才稍微琢磨得出了神。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29e95b58d7256b9beb083001905e7a6e03e9b4111cd235b4dd3df2a64aff4839",
      "text": "要是拍摄的时候老鼠跑出来，就拜托你支援了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0586a3b3c27e607993e89d1dad327bb111e09edf67f898a6579041d0bfbfe0",
      "text": "如果是这样的话，请不要勉强自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48e6bccedd73b294f2d1181b14930c4ec9672fc7f2d65894ad781daab5041882",
      "text": "别啊，让俺做吧！\n俺想回应选择了俺的人的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6edc1d988221b1104dbd6df7a89fa70b10658b5a7ad8a828af4eb4d5746041",
      "text": "……我知道了。那么，这项工作就继续推进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c1b9db79dde2bf4c5c55dac3c68c2959743fef3d46605a8266bc26b317a8449",
      "text": "谢谢你啊，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:540dc3a47b06eb5b895caa63319f24522c604e094fef3ded417303ddb4f18d9f",
      "text": "但是，绝对不能勉强。要是觉得受不了，\n请当场提出来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb72f4cf9192119b7d4e3e2dc96dd25ed600cdb8c5cb9abc548841d104b1f185",
      "text": "哦，那是自然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c339532d281f49fe18eeba6f41ac78cb0c250aa656b7e8c5aeee998560aed995",
      "text": "外景当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c421848fcb67e6cc9f98ddf78d7af9f2ec7b9e44cb0621c7a114b9da72e5fb5",
      "text": "外景顺利结束真是太好了呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:083a3a25da3a094ed36229baea9247b42febb602d979c8ddc96fabce29eae2ff",
      "text": "是啊。不过，拍摄中老鼠跑出来的时候\n我还以为要遭了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faf0ed6fae6ebd16e02e767f5659fcb3e9c5a9d0a630ed6991ba8e81e097fe11",
      "text": "啊啊，是俺慌慌张张逃跑的时候吧。\n也多亏了那样才找到了大宝贝就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:590df503f06f90203aa7c61a8b4d589754eeee33920564ee65c6e2043b9f01d6",
      "text": "那真是今天最让俺吃惊的事了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e1dab5794781a0e0948b84687254305921cd3ba70d056b740138b0b6aa6a8b5",
      "text": "虽说确实如此，\n但您居然还懂刀剑的好坏，真厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53c610ca106419fed8154c1a8d603d51ff176418d8500f9019160c079b6d5aa",
      "text": "哇哈哈！碰巧而已啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e661ac02bf334f216bbf665b19b010dfe0b99846011d6d5365763e85da97f7c3",
      "text": "俺练居合道的嘛，\n练习时经常能看到刀剑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3c63640024e6cfc5a04d01ed41b273c0029fba3998dfecec60df37029e9cad",
      "text": "话说回来，真没想到能遇上那样的名刀啊！\n哇哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d467ffd77499cb7eef66f2c807081e17f1ecd3851a4f3f2d70a44bc1067451f",
      "text": "节目的导演也高兴得不行，\n直呼“竟然能找到这样的宝物！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b336bfdf3c2e92fb139d8a726d3efdd52aaeef86969f4b0301ab77fdffc3d1ae",
      "text": "能看到那个笑容，俺也很高兴啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37e269baad8ad6c27aeae2adeb09924e6d728fa1f802a74a05c787304e3d9cb7",
      "text": "这次录制大获成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b1770605a067a0042c6fd7ee31c131282f7f6944802e394066f115645f5379",
      "text": "是的！最重要的是，老鼠出来时大吾先生\n平安无事真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66d10c44d61b0dac699ce847a459be2890ce4859ca1b0092e0708529d239618b",
      "text": "哇哈哈。还真是这样呢——。\n让Boss操心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66bf3f840f6dd28596c0418eaeb6f194c1704713e8201b063f088022d076fcf3",
      "text": "确实很担心。但我深信，只要是大吾先生\n就一定能够顺利完成的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be6944a90d52e770da9b193d7ff9b05d6a3dd75a8982833848ca6e7b63fc4832",
      "text": "而且，今天的工作实际上也圆满成功了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f118c3754da07c6ee00f81d29625642a1bc2b54cdc7feb83443fe0701b77873",
      "text": "虽然俺之前没说，但外景前看到仓库时，\n俺就知道这地方肯定会有那玩意儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d7fd4b3d9fa27d140b8acc7ac332bd12b7f77bec9a87e236d2946b4b6df3f30",
      "text": "但是，有Boss陪着俺。\n不管发生什么都没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:078de7454b2f2fbc653e3a27f0f30365c4419b808dfaa5374fd42c5661ac13d6",
      "text": "只要这么一想，平时害怕老鼠的\n念头就淡化了不少呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9e298e9c5ad4ca9ed341bd7abf616ed53d0afcdf5535fef2e9000a6f3e39a32",
      "text": "如果我能帮上忙的话，那就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f104af0281f562b8b67d3493dfd71070d3cc0ed3d2b7c5852c1227fe034308f4",
      "text": "嗯！谢啦，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b24f780d6706a238f4bd37b1ebc5cd3caf61f073b74d6622119d0c0f040ff90e",
      "text": "虽然出了点小意外，\n但总归是次开心的拍摄呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c09bf875b78536ef3a067f87aa58eab7f692aeb775d5c166664771483f7bd8c",
      "text": "是啊，真期待播出的日子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabf68b383b701bbfe0b5b25a99639f8ba4445fa838fc24d16d91b86846e8418",
      "text": "嗯！\n好期待会被剪辑成什么样啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80b9f58bc5092ca95b957be46c199a0869089cbd9f321e4abdc1e972ae70f1e4",
      "text": "嗯——，还有啊，Boss。\n有个请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccf31b375de4dce2efa34bf4d6f746f24092599f4d6c18cda458d911450d5bfe",
      "text": "是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e5dd632dbed59e18a6cbccade46c351f8ba93f7b429b45c16467079777729ef",
      "text": "凉和老师他们两个，肯定都会看\n俺出演的节目的吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bef95de6ed32f175e150e6a4b49ac25c9ba6fe1cc77f32940b65921b6cdf5609",
      "text": "俺怕老鼠这事，\n在节目播出之前希望能替俺保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00c5c600c3f9f8d2c2fa29c2ad00d4d544d7353bc1bbac9c1047d1419aa6b37c",
      "text": "明白了！\n既然大吾先生这么说，我会保密的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b9037f8fc4a39e8ba61dd107d4f8d417430dda6c3b839f8b11f6dc8652735f",
      "text": "多谢啦！\n虽然也不是什么非瞒着不可的事，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d781bf7e26d6fdf282921fabe505bbde30b4501fb629ef3d0173407af2c1e043",
      "text": "但这是俺和Boss，两个人的秘密嘛。\n这样一来，还稍微有点让人兴奋呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
